    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c6f510a4fdf5670d8dfeb8e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说实话，身体已经到极限了……\r\n……要向死而生地赌一把吗？",
